  ('MQ-fa8623-7-2', 'fa8623', 20, '7', '(iii) In the given diagram, ABC is a triangle, where $\mathrm{B}(4, - 4)$ and $\mathrm{C}(-4, - 2)$ . D is a point on AC. [4]

